- op: create  # 061d
  at: '2026-06-26T18:35:22Z'  # 061d
  by: agent  # 061d
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 061d
  clock: 1  # 061d
  nonce: 061d  # 061d
  data:  # 061d
    kind: work_item  # 061d
    title: "Call graph misses obj.method()/property short-name resolution: in-repo methods resolve to :unresolved, inflating dead-code FPs"  # 061d
    status: todo_hard  # 061d
    priority: 2  # 061d
    parent:  # 061d
    tags:  # 061d
    - analysis_quality  # 061d
    isbefore: []  # 061d
    duplicate_of: []  # 061d
    not_duplicate_of: []  # 061d
    pr_ref:  # 061d
    description: "Surfaced during dispatch:F8 PR-B. Instance method calls (obj.method()) and @property/@staticmethod/@classmethod access resolve to python:external:0-0:<name>:unresolved instead of the in-repo method/property symbol, so production methods/properties appear unreachable in the call graph and are flagged as dead-code false positives. Measured on the repo under dead-code-maybe --seeds all: @property/@staticmethod/@classmethod methods dead at 34/57 (60%) vs plain undecorated methods 486/909 (53%) — comparable, i.e. the decorator is NOT load-bearing in the deadness; it is the GENERAL short-name method-call resolution gap. Properties like Symbol.end_line (260 refs) / ValidationResult.ok (47 refs) are dead for the same reason undecorated methods are. This is the RESIDUAL after INV-pohik's three named dispatch families (route->handler [F1], closure-factory [F8 PR-A], descriptor-protocol [shown vacuous]) were resolved, and is DISTINCT from them — INV-pohik did not name general method-call resolution as one of its families. Likely shares the py.py call-resolution substrate (the flat last-write-wins symbol_by_name dict / the not-yet-landed scope-stack rewrite identity:F1/F4a) and overlaps dispatch:F3 (alias/builtin/reference resolution, currently BLOCKED on the same rewrite + INV-nilud). Fix requires receiver-type / method resolution so obj.method() edges land on the real in-repo symbol rather than an :unresolved external. Evidence: gate test packages/hypergumbo-core/tests/test_dispatch_closure_gate.py TestDescriptorProtocolFamilyIsVacuousOnCorpus docstring."  # 061d
    fields: {}  # 061d
