  message: "WI-hiziz D1 COMPLETE (PR-1/2/3, last landed dev 7109758f92): the full inherited-method + inherited-field resolution mass now lands for Python — Site-2 typed-receiver-inherited (C3 walker, PR-1), Site-1 self.method() inherited (PR-2), Site-3 self.field.method() inherited (PR-3). Combined with Part A (typed-receiver-direct / local static+classmethod) and D2 (WI-gubar @property reads), the walker-independent + walker-dependent recall for obj.method()/self.method()/self.field.method()/@property is all landed. The SOLE remaining WI-noham residual is WI-supat/D3 — concrete-class-id precision (thread a concrete enclosing/receiver class id so the _SITE1_STRICT_LANGS ambiguity guards recover the same-short-name + cross-language recall they currently sacrifice). WI-noham stays OPEN pending WI-supat + bakeoff re-measurement of the INV-nuzas 283-twin residual and the decorated/plain deadness deltas."  # 17e5
