  message: "DONE — bakeoff re-measure, dev @ 371adbe47c (WI-supat PR-A+PR-B + the finalize relativization fix that made the concrete-id path actually fire). BEHAVIORAL EVIDENCE (re-ran WI-noham's own filed repro, dead-code-maybe --seeds all on hypergumbo self-analysis): the flagship deadness repros CLEAR — Symbol.end_line and ValidationResult.ok are NOT in the dead-code list (both reachable; Symbol.end_line 1 incoming resolved calls edge, ValidationResult.ok 7, all ast_call_type_inferred via the WI-gubar @property->Site-2 chain). Dead python methods ~486->153 (dead_candidates 381/4597, 8.3%); demoted_dispatch_inherited=0 (inherited resolution DIRECT). RECALL fires on two large real-world Python repos: hypergumbo self 243 inherited_calls edges (81 Site-1 + 60 Site-2-MRO + 102 Site-2-direct); pretix (119MB Django) 533 (405 Site-1 + 56 Site-2-direct + 49 Site-2-MRO + 23 Site-3 ast_call_inherited_field). NO REGRESSIONS across 4 cohorts / 19 repos / 9 languages. All pieces landed: Part A + D1/WI-hiziz + D2/WI-gubar + D3/WI-supat. NOTE: INV-nuzas is NOT closed by this — its phantom-workspace-external residual (107) is dispatch:F3 (cross-module function calls + module_attr_ref), a distinct mechanism WI-noham does not own."  # 4a26
